>>
Rule 1 (source tensor x must be at least 1-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 2 (indices tensor i must be a vector)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1
>>
Rule 3 (x and v must have identical dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 4 (v must match x in rank and all trailing dimensions; its leading dimension equals i’s length)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_3) ∧ shape(v_3, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∧ ∀ d ∈ [1, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_3, d) = shape(v_1, d)
>>
Rule 5 (operation name should not be the placeholder string "none")
{v_1 : str} |= v_1 ≠ "none"
